<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant attacks continue in Jammu and Kashmir, with a recent gunbattle in Pakistan's Khyber Pakhtunkhwa killing 10 policemen and 18 militants, and a terror attack on CRPF personnel in Kulgam injuring three jawans, one critically. Two SPOs have gone missing in Kishtwar, prompting a massive search operation, while security forces in Manipur arrested five suspected cadres of KYKL, PREPAK and PLA. Heightened security measures include NIA teams collecting samples at the Kulgam site and increased drone deployment. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOdXF0ejRoQUl2Zk5JZm9VdnRROU5ZbFFoZWFUMTJJWW9uYXIyMklwaW43OEIyNVdnVE1oLUJvelVqN0ktbmw4bDg2Q0VuN2tvZlVUMU81MFRsd01MZ0phWVZxQ0JRQVFwSzBlTmhRSFM1TmFtQ1FMQ1JZX3B3M3RHUkNMZ0swVWlYSDY1WDl3bkJMZFpQMkZOSzlQR09zdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Independent Media Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Greater Kashmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNQ1kzSkpYVXdIdUw1MnQtWmVnR0s3OXZYRXQ0czRRMExST3c3UGdCT21ZUzlJd2dzRUFtT21oM1ZhU3BfX05rWUIwdGVPSFZZajl2YzBhRGNQMjM4ZmNTMTI5eGZqbUR4LTA3VHJ3Y0RhOXVvRzNsOXNWazV6Q2lpMWdCVGM2ZkloM29qZklrdHEwZ3c5alA5aEpYVmJiT2dzZEVBRkptLVBodzhxRmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Independent Media Service&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NDTV&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ETV Bharat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQZVg4cmJiRlFwU0REbFEyVExPbHVXUWpSQkFrMl85cUFyeFRhMEtEU0dVWklWTGw1QlI5WDVOUmoyYUFFLVVQX0UxNGtNdjZaR2ZPVWdneVRYeXpIX2xTY3lEbVNjRS1MblpBakVZc0swdTgxRTl1ejAzN3RmNzVKS0oxbkxYUDVJYjNKQWUtNkdOMmYxbW10ME0tMTFBVy1sVTR4SGYwM3lDT2NrekNfV2lCUU4xaVVid1RoT2NB0gG-AUFVX3lxTE1nMWN2eVoycDZLd0